    %%dashboard admin-concentrations title: admin: Who the records belong to role: admin reports: ticket-per-customer, ticket-impact-score-per-customer, ticket-per-agent, ticket-impact-score-per-agent, comment-per-ticket help: Which customers, owners or parents account for the most records and the most value.
